[在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →](https://mizjeannie.com/almanac)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for Friday, November 20, 2026. Color: Orange — confidence, creativity, success, opportunity. Plant: Yarrow (Achillea millefolium) — protection, boundaries, courage, love. Oil: Basil essential oil — prosperity, love. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b0029983168b.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:06:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>月球与三主题的奇特合影</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff981f4064c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;三个不同的主体看起来好古怪哈哈，我只是想拍张月亮的照片&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a very blue sky with the top of a building at the bottom, a plane at cruising altitude in the center, and the moon " height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aff981f4064c.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:45:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>下午五点的情绪</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff6e9a93e24</link><description>&lt;p&gt;下午五点的心情 III&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A black-and-white photograph of a lit motorway running through a dark landscape, which curves to the right in the left-hand part of the frame. The title comes from the fact that the photograph was taken at 5 pm. " height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aff6e9a93e24.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:48:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>傍晚散步</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff5b8e3202f</link><descri